      "statement": "Alert 2, fan_in:A-9895:1794319200000: account A-9895, window 1794319200000–1794322800000, 6 distinct senders, 6 transfers, total 15000 minor units. Contributing transfers: T0035 (A-8770), T0036 (A-4399), T0037 (A-4792), T0038 (A-9088), T0039 (A-8060), T0040 (A-8166), each exactly 2500, each from a different device.",
