      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F3",
      "statement": "Alert 1 onward routes: all six contributing transfers have onward links. T0002, T0003 and T0006 link to T0007 (A-9278→A-5092, 138000), then T0008 (A-5092→A-2897, 135000), then T0009 (A-2897→A-4989, 132000). T0010, T0011 and T0012 link to T0014 (A-9278→A-5092, 210000), then T0015 (A-5092→A-2897, 206000), then T0016 (A-2897→A-4989, 202000). The longest chain is 3 onward links. Both routes come to rest at A-4989: T0009 and T0016 are not passed on.",
