      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F4",
      "statement": "Alert 2 onward routes: only T0038, T0039 and T0040 have onward links, each a single link to T0041 (A-9895→A-1415, 14000). T0041 is not passed on, so these routes come to rest at A-1415 after at most 1 onward link. T0035, T0036 and T0037 have no onward link, so in this data their credits stop at A-9895. A-1415 does later send T0055 (90000 to A-9514, 1794333900000), but that is 11,700,000 ms after T0041, beyond the 1,800,000 ms onward gap, and is not a recorded onward link.",
      "claim_ids": [
