      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "F7",
      "statement": "Onward links match by account and time, not by amount. T0007 (138000) is linked from credits totalling 141500; T0014 (210000) is linked from credits totalling 215500, and it falls 200000 ms after the alert window ends. T0041 (14000) is linked from credits totalling 7500. So the links do not show that particular funds moved; they show only that a debit followed credits within 1,800,000 ms.",
